    "P19 uses36h esiRNA while HepG2/RAW use shRNA; timing and knockdown magnitude not equated.",
    "Whole-cell and cytoplasmic P19 measurements come from the same cell source and cannot count as two cell models.",
    "Shared controls induce dependency across targets; repeated source subsets add no independent targets.",
    "PerturbAtlas missing-record semantics remain unresolved; no zero imputation.",
    "Original RAW264.7 files are declared RPKM; they cannot be normalized as raw counts.",
    "P19 original Cufflinks gene-count tables require numeric/column/replicate inspection before use."
